<title>UK: IGC authority to meet on Eurotunnel this week.</title>
<headline>IGC authority to meet on Eurotunnel this week.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Anglo-French Intergovernmental Commission, which governs Channel Tunnel operator Eurotunnel Plc SA, is due to meet on Wednesday or Thursday this week, an official spokeswoman said.</p>
</text>
